{"v":2,"s":"p","w":1,"steps":[{"t":"read","h":"Quantities and units","b":"<p>A <b>physical quantity</b> (fizička veličina) is a number with a unit: 5 m, 3 s, 70 kg. Without the unit, the number means nothing.</p><p>The SI base units: metre (m), kilogram (kg), second (s), ampere (A), kelvin (K), mole (mol), candela (cd). Everything else is derived: m/s, N = kg·m/s², J = N·m, Pa = N/m².</p><div class=\"callout\">Currency exchange: convert everything to one currency (SI) before you add or compare.</div>"},{"t":"read","h":"Prefixes","b":"<table class=\"mini\"><tr><td>M (mega)</td><td>10⁶</td></tr><tr><td>k (kilo)</td><td>10³</td></tr><tr><td>c (centi)</td><td>10⁻²</td></tr><tr><td>m (mili)</td><td>10⁻³</td></tr><tr><td>µ (mikro)</td><td>10⁻⁶</td></tr><tr><td>n (nano)</td><td>10⁻⁹</td></tr></table><p>Careful with area and volume — the prefix is squared or cubed: 1 m² = 10⁴ cm², 1 m³ = 10⁶ cm³, 1 L = 1 dm³ = 10⁻³ m³.</p><figure class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 106\" text-anchor=\"middle\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"SI prefixes jump by a factor of 1000. Every step right on this line is ×1000.\"><defs><marker id=\"ah\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"ink\"/></marker><marker id=\"ahc\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" class=\"a\"/></marker></defs><line x1=\"14\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"306\" y2=\"40\" class=\"k\" /><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"46\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"24\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"acc\">n</text><text x=\"24\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"11\">10⁻⁹</text><line x1=\"78\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"78\" y2=\"46\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"78\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"acc\">µ</text><text x=\"78\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"11\">10⁻⁶</text><line x1=\"132\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"132\" y2=\"46\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"132\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"acc\">m</text><text x=\"132\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"11\">10⁻³</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"46\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"186\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"acc\">—</text><text x=\"186\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"11\">10⁰</text><line x1=\"240\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"240\" y2=\"46\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"240\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"acc\">k</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"11\">10³</text><line x1=\"294\" y1=\"34\" x2=\"294\" y2=\"46\" class=\"k\" /><text x=\"294\" y=\"26\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" class=\"acc\">M</text><text x=\"294\" y=\"62\" font-size=\"11\">10⁶</text><text x=\"57\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"10\">virus</text><text x=\"57\" y=\"99\" font-size=\"10\" class=\"mut\">100 nm</text><text x=\"132\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"10\">sand grain</text><text x=\"132\" y=\"99\" font-size=\"10\" class=\"mut\">1 mm</text><text x=\"186\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"10\">you</text><text x=\"186\" y=\"99\" font-size=\"10\" class=\"mut\">1.7 m</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"10\">Beograd–Niš</text><text x=\"256\" y=\"99\" font-size=\"10\" class=\"mut\">240 km</text></svg><figcaption>SI prefixes jump by a factor of 1000. Every step right on this line is ×1000.</figcaption></figure>"},{"t":"read","h":"Speed conversions","b":"<div class=\"fx\">km/h → m/s: divide by 3.6   m/s → km/h: multiply by 3.6</div><p>Because 1 km/h = 1000 m / 3600 s.</p><p><b>Scalars</b> have only size (mass, time, temperature). <b>Vectors</b> also have direction (velocity, force).</p>"},{"t":"ex","q":"Convert 108 km/h to m/s and 2.5 g/cm³ to kg/m³.","s":["108 / 3.6 = 30 m/s.","1 g/cm³ = 1000 kg/m³, so 2.5 g/cm³ = 2500 kg/m³."],"a":"30 m/s; 2500 kg/m³"},{"t":"num","q":"36 km/h in m/s?","a":10,"u":"m/s","e":"36 / 3.6."},{"t":"num","q":"2.5 km in metres?","a":2500,"u":"m","e":"×1000."},{"t":"num","q":"3 L in m³?","a":0.003,"u":"m³","e":"1 L = 0.001 m³.","tol":0.0001},{"t":"mc","q":"1 cm² equals:","o":["10⁻² m²","10⁻⁴ m²","10⁻⁶ m²","10² m²"],"a":1,"e":"(10⁻² m)² = 10⁻⁴ m²."},{"t":"num","q":"15 m/s in km/h?","a":54,"u":"km/h","e":"15 · 3.6."}]}